                    Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in the Netherlands</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Norweb</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >The Hague</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1929-06-22T11:00:00+01:19">June 22, 1929—11
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received June 22—7:50 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>35. Department’s telegram 16, June 17, 11 a.m.<anchor n="71" xml:id="d477-f1"/>
                    Permission to land and free entry accorded.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Norweb</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
